# Reddit API credentials (PRAW)
#
# How to obtain:
# 1. Go to https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
# 2. Click "create app..." or "create another app..."
# 3. Choose "script" as the app type
# 4. Name: marchand-index-pilot (or anything)
# 5. About URL: leave blank
# 6. Redirect URI: http://localhost:8080
# 7. Click "create app"
# 8. Copy the alphanumeric string under the app name (this is the client_id)
# 9. Copy the "secret" string (this is the client_secret)
# 10. Paste both below, then save this file as `.env` (without the .example suffix)

REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
REDDIT_USER_AGENT=marchand-index-pilot/0.1 by u/your_reddit_username

# No other credentials needed. Wikipedia, Google Trends, NHL API, Instagram (instaloader public mode), PuckPedia are all unauthenticated.
